    <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Learning and Development Services for staff of the Institutions, Bodies and Agencies (IBAs) of the European Union</cbc:Name>
    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The call for tenders concerns the provision of training and e-learning services to the EU Institutions and more than 50 other Bodies and Agencies of the European Union.
It will be divided into 6 lots:
Lot 1	European and international affairs, EU governance and policymaking
Lot 2	Human Resources (HR)
Lot 3	Negotiation (for EU Negotiation professionals)
Lot 4	Communication (for EU Communication professionals)
Lot 5	Finance, accounting, fraud prevention, internal and external control &amp; audit
Lot 6	 Media content development</cbc:Description>
    <cbc:ProcurementTypeCode listName="contract-nature">services</cbc:ProcurementTypeCode>
    <cbc:Note languageID="ENG">This prior information notice announces the intention of the contracting authority to publish a future call for tenders. No other information or documents are available at this stage. Interested economic operators are invited to subscribe at the link https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities/tender-details/af614f08-1675-4225-8bc9-2aedfca2350a-PIN in order to get notified when the contract notice and all the procurement documents, including the tender specifications, are published.
